This repository is published under different licences for its parts.

1. Code (the files in src/ and tests/): MIT License (text below).
2. Own documents and data (README.md, README.en.md, SOURCES.md, docs/, data/, calib/, second/, xcheck/):
   Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
   data/key.tsv rewrites Satoshi Tomokiyo's reconstructed table (Cryptiana) with symbol names, with
   additions marked in src/vk.py (source C); the rights in his table are his.
   second/*_pass*.txt and calib/codex_as_tx/ are outputs of OpenAI Codex given only line images and second/PROMPT.md.

These licences do not extend to the content of the historical sources or of other people's work quoted here.

